        "sourceKey": "fl:statute:893.13:4",
        "target": "text",
        "text": "Except as authorized by this chapter, a person 18 years of age or older may not deliver any controlled substance to a person younger than 18 years of age, use or hire a person younger than 18 years of age as an agent or employee in the sale or delivery of such a substance, or use such person to assist in avoiding detection or apprehension for a violation of this chapter.",
        "start": 12563,
        "end": 12936,
